model g14_list_1000000
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.6 (#89, P35, finding 7): a list index of 1 000 000 keys, k1 to k1000000: the cap itself, answered (L §7.6 item 2, §8.3 LOAD-LIMIT). Its twin is list_1000001.tally."

index x = [@keys k 1 1000000@]

ask n: count(k in x)
